# Runtime knowledge base — CLIO's churning learning state (2,700+ files, ~21MB).
# Was tracked only as an artifact of `git add -A` pre-CC-session checkpoints, not
# deliberate versioning. Untracked 2026-06-15 (operator-approved DR hygiene) to
# match tradingbot's gitignored state/. Files stay on disk; covered by ~/backups
# (hourly) + Hetzner daily image. Hydrinia bridge dir data/knowledge/trade_ideas
# is read from disk, unaffected by this rule.
data/knowledge/
# .claude/ stays local (settings, hooks, skills), except the two read-only memory-compaction
# agents (2026-09-28). `**` + a re-included dir, never a trailing-slash parent (anti-pattern #23).
.claude/**
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/memory-*.md
*.lock
*.bak
*.backup
.gitnexus/
# Inferred: AGENTS.md is local/operator guidance, not CLIO runtime source.
AGENTS.md

# Graphify knowledge graph output
graphify-out/

